6:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 max-w-[62ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-3","children":"Chat, images, vision, voice, documents - on iOS, Android, macOS, and Windows, running on hardware you own. Local models keep your prompts on your device. If you connect a remote model, Off Grid AI sends requests only to the server you choose. Off Grid AI Pro adds one intelligence layer across your phone and laptop. The layer that merges the two is landing through July."}]
